{"service": "每日英语听力 · 内容后台", "generated_at": "2026-10-08T12:44:07.969685+00:00", "latest": {"date": "2026-10-08", "versions": {"en": [{"content_hash": "34a97c8a7c74e3cf", "version_id": 281, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Nvidia Bets on Safe Robots and Self-Driving Cars", "title_zh": "英伟达押注安全机器人和自动驾驶汽车", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 125, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "Nvidia is a big chip company. It now works on safe robots and self-driving cars. It wants these machines to help people, not hurt them.", "lead_zh": "英伟达是一家大型芯片公司。现在它也做安全机器人和自动驾驶汽车。它希望这些机器能帮助人，而不是伤害人。", "preview": "Nvidia makes computer chips. The company is now worth a lot of money. It also spends billions on robots and self-driving cars. It wants thes", "preview_zh": "英伟达生产电脑芯片。这家公司现在市值很高。它还花数十亿美元做机器人和自动驾驶汽车。它希望这些机器是安全的。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 271, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 58.15, "size_bytes": 352656, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 144, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/281.json"}, {"content_hash": "7a4086f90eff9d35", "version_id": 282, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Nvidia Pushes Safer Robots and Self-Driving Cars", "title_zh": "英伟达力推更安全的机器人和自动驾驶汽车", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 158, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Nvidia is spending billions on robots and self-driving cars. It built a safety system called Halos. Companies now use it to keep people safe around machines.", "lead_zh": "英伟达正投入数十亿美元研发机器人和自动驾驶汽车。它开发了一套名为Halos的安全系统。现在许多公司用它来保护机器周围人员的安全。", "preview": "Nvidia makes AI chips. It also invests in physical AI, like robots and self-driving cars. In 2025, it started a safety system called Halos. ", "preview_zh": "英伟达生产AI芯片。它也投资实体AI，比如机器人和自动驾驶汽车。2025年，它推出了一套名为Halos的安全系统。2026年6月，它又为机器人推出了Halos。这套系统帮助机器人在人身边安全地工作。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 272, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 74.7, "size_bytes": 451872, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 185, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/282.json"}, {"content_hash": "7d28cb69e9224118", "version_id": 283, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Nvidia's Halos System Aims for Safer Robots and Self-Driving Cars", "title_zh": "英伟达推出Halos系统，让机器人和自动驾驶汽车更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 275, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Nvidia is investing billions in physical AI, which includes robots and self-driving cars. The company has built a safety system called Halos to help these machines work safely around people.", "lead_zh": "英伟达正在物理AI领域投入数十亿美元，包括机器人和自动驾驶汽车。该公司开发了一套名为Halos的安全系统，帮助这些机器安全地在人类周围工作。", "preview": "Nvidia is famous for AI chips, but it has also bet billions on physical AI, such as robots and self-driving cars. To reduce the risk of mach", "preview_zh": "英伟达以AI芯片闻名，但它也在物理AI上投入了数十亿美元，比如机器人和自动驾驶汽车。为了降低机器伤害人的风险，英伟达打造了一套全栈安全系统。它在2025年推出了用于自动驾驶汽车的Halos，并在2026年6月宣布了面向机器人的Halos。这套系统帮助机器人在仓库、工厂甚至医院里安", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 273, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 116.787, "size_bytes": 704448, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/283.json"}, {"content_hash": "6a17b2993d9e287a", "version_id": 284, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Nvidia's Big Bet on Physical AI Aims for Safer Robotaxis and Humanoid Robots", "title_zh": "英伟达押注物理AI，想让自动驾驶出租车和人形机器人更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 253, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Nvidia is investing billions in physical AI, including robots and self-driving cars. Its full-stack safety system, called Halos, is now being used by several robotics companies.", "lead_zh": "英伟达正投入数十亿美元发展物理AI，包括机器人和自动驾驶汽车。其名为Halos的全栈安全系统目前已被多家机器人公司采用。", "preview": "Nvidia is known for AI chips that power data centers, but the company has also invested billions in physical AI, such as robotics and self-d", "preview_zh": "英伟达以驱动数据中心的AI芯片闻名，但该公司也在物理AI领域投入了数十亿美元，比如机器人和自动驾驶汽车。这项努力的关键部分是一个全栈安全系统，公司可以用它来降低机器伤害附近人员的风险。英伟达的Halos系统于2025年推出，为自动驾驶汽车提供工具，并于2026年6月扩展到机器人领", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 274, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 108.85, "size_bytes": 656928, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 274, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/284.json"}, {"content_hash": "c97ccae350140cc3", "version_id": 285, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Nvidia's Physical AI Bet Targets Safer Robots and Robotaxis", "title_zh": "英伟达押注物理AI，想让机器人和无人出租车更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 461, "reading_minutes": 2.3, "lead": "Nvidia is pouring billions into physical AI, betting that a full-stack safety system can unlock safer robotaxis and humanoid robots. Its Halos platform, now extended to robotics, aims to let machines work alongside people without barriers.", "lead_zh": "英伟达豪掷数十亿美元押注物理AI，赌的是一套全栈安全系统能让无人出租车和人形机器人更安全。其Halos平台如今已扩展到机器人领域，目标是让机器无需隔离屏障就能与人协同工作。", "preview": "While investors bullish on AI data centers have propelled Nvidia to a multitrillion-dollar market capitalization, the chipmaker has quietly ", "preview_zh": "看涨AI数据中心的投资者把英伟达推上了数万亿美元市值，但这家芯片制造商也在物理AI——机器人技术和自动驾驶汽车——上悄悄押下了数十亿美元。这一赌局的核心是一套全栈安全系统，企业可以在此基础上开发，以降低机器伤及周围人员的风险。英伟达的Halos系统于2025年推出，为自动驾驶汽车", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 275, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 200.0, "size_bytes": 1203840, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 524, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/285.json"}, {"content_hash": "79290ff279ff32dc", "version_id": 291, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Wood Blankets Help Save Frozen Arctic Soil", "title_zh": "木头毯子帮忙保护北极冻土", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 173, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "A Canadian company has a new idea to protect frozen soil in the Arctic. They put blankets made of wood on the ground. This can stop the soil from melting and releasing harmful gas.", "lead_zh": "一家加拿大公司有了保护北极冻土的新点子。他们在地上铺用木头做的毯子。这样可以防止土壤融化并释放有害气体。", "preview": "The Arctic is getting warmer. The frozen ground, called permafrost, is melting. When it melts, it releases carbon dioxide and methane. These", "preview_zh": "北极正在变暖。被称为永久冻土的冻结地面正在融化。融化时会释放二氧化碳和甲烷。这些气体让气候变化更严重。一家叫 PermaC 的公司想阻止这件事。他们用木头碎片、土壤和椰子纤维做成毯子。他们把毯子铺在融化地面的边缘。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 281, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 73.588, "size_bytes": 445248, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 198, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/291.json"}, {"content_hash": "55f81d4c89816352", "version_id": 292, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Woody Blankets Help Save Arctic Permafrost", "title_zh": "用木头“毯子”保护北极冻土", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 249, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "A Canadian company is testing special blankets made from wood. They want to stop frozen ground from melting and releasing harmful gases.", "lead_zh": "一家加拿大公司正在测试用木头做的特殊毯子。他们想阻止冻土融化，避免有害气体释放出来。", "preview": "A Canadian start-up called PermaC is testing a new idea. They put a blanket of woody materials on frozen ground in the Arctic. The blanket h", "preview_zh": "一家名为PermaC的加拿大初创公司正在测试一个新想法。他们把一种木质材料做的毯子铺在北极的冻土上。毯子帮助地面保持寒冷和稳定。这可以阻止温室气体逃逸。Cansu Culha是PermaC的联合创始人。她说：“我们的目标是确保土壤中的碳继续埋在地下。”", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 282, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 103.763, "size_bytes": 626400, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 287, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/292.json"}, {"content_hash": "c4a5b7b7c671fda3", "version_id": 293, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Woody 'Blankets' Help Protect Arctic Permafrost and Cut Emissions", "title_zh": "用木质“毯子”保护北极冻土，减少碳排放", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 397, "reading_minutes": 2.0, "lead": "A Canadian company is testing special blankets made of wood and plant materials. The goal is to stop frozen Arctic soil from melting and releasing harmful gases.", "lead_zh": "一家加拿大公司正在测试用木头和植物材料做的特殊毯子。目的是阻止北极冻土融化并释放有害气体。", "preview": "A Canadian start-up called PermaC is developing a new way to reduce greenhouse gases. The company uses an insulating 'blanket' of woody mate", "preview_zh": "一家名为PermaC的加拿大初创公司正在开发减少温室气体的新方法。该公司用木质材料制成的隔热“毯子”来稳定土壤。如果这个方法有效，它可能是第一个直接阻止冻土排放气体的工具。PermaC联合创始人坎苏·库拉说，他们的目标是让土壤中的碳继续埋在地下。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 283, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 162.562, "size_bytes": 979200, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 457, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/293.json"}, {"content_hash": "297ffd3ae7b3effe", "version_id": 294, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Woody blankets slow Arctic permafrost thaw and cut carbon", "title_zh": "用木头“毯子”给北极冻土保温，减少碳排放", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 375, "reading_minutes": 1.9, "lead": "A Canadian company is testing blankets made of woody materials to stop Arctic permafrost from eroding. If the idea works, it could be the first tool to directly prevent greenhouse gases from escaping the soil.", "lead_zh": "一家加拿大公司正在测试用木质材料做成的“毯子”，阻止北极永久冻土被侵蚀。如果这个方法有效，它可能成为第一种直接阻止温室气体从土壤中逸出的工具。", "preview": "As the Arctic gets warmer, frozen ground known as permafrost is thawing, and carbon that has been buried for thousands of years is being rel", "preview_zh": "随着北极变暖，被称为永久冻土的冻结地面正在融化，埋藏了数千年的碳正以二氧化碳和甲烷的形式释放出来。在全球范围内减缓这一过程最可靠的办法，是减少化石燃料的排放。不过，一些研究人员正在探索直接保护冻土的方法，例如在冰川上铺设反光垫。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 284, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 146.8, "size_bytes": 884592, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 423, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/294.json"}, {"content_hash": "d7486b579b16a85b", "version_id": 295, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Woody 'Blankets' Deployed on Arctic Permafrost to Curb Emissions", "title_zh": "给北极冻土盖“木头毯子”，能减少碳排放吗？", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 446, "reading_minutes": 2.2, "lead": "A Canadian start-up is testing whether insulating blankets of woody material can halt the rapid erosion of Arctic permafrost and, in doing so, keep its carbon locked underground.", "lead_zh": "一家加拿大初创公司正在测试一种用木质材料制成的保温毯，看看它能否阻止北极冻土的快速侵蚀，从而把碳继续封存在地下。", "preview": "A Canadian start-up, PermaC, is pioneering a method to forestall greenhouse-gas emissions from thawing permafrost by stabilising the soil wi", "preview_zh": "加拿大初创公司PermaC正在开创一种方法：用木质材料制成的保温“毯子”稳固土壤，从而阻止冻土融化释放温室气体。如果这项技术被证明有效，它将成为首个专门用来防止北极变暖过程中冻土排放气体的工具。PermaC联合创始人、不列颠哥伦比亚大学自然灾害研究员詹苏·库尔哈表示：“我们的目标", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 285, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 183.662, "size_bytes": 1105776, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 509, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/295.json"}], "ja": [{"content_hash": "d0ac6fee6387fd2a", "version_id": 286, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "ja_n5", "lang": "ja", "level": 1, "level_label": "N5 初級", "title": "エヌビディア、ロボットの安全を考える新しいシステムを作る", "title_zh": "英伟达推出新系统，让机器人更安全地工作", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 466, "reading_minutes": 1.5, "lead": "エヌビディアは、ロボットや自動車の安全を守る新しいシステムを作りました。このシステムは「ハロス」といいます。ロボットが人と一緒に安全に働くためのものです。", "lead_zh": "英伟达开发了一套新系统，用来保护机器人和汽车的安全。这个系统叫“Halos”。它能让机器人和人一起安全地工作。", "preview": "エヌビディアは、ロボットと自動運転車の安全を守るシステムを作りました。名前は「ハロス」です。ハロスは、ハードウェアとソフトウェアを組み合わせたものです。ロボットや車が人を傷つけないようにします。", "preview_zh": "英伟达开发了一套保护机器人和自动驾驶汽车安全的系统，名字叫“Halos”。Halos把硬件和软件结合在一起，防止机器人或汽车伤害到人。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 276, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 98.288, "size_bytes": 593424, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 282, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/286.json"}, {"content_hash": "bd600966b0b10d23", "version_id": 287, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "Nvidia、安全なロボットと自動運転の技術を発表", "title_zh": "英伟达发布让机器人和自动驾驶更安全的新技术", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 432, "reading_minutes": 1.6, "lead": "Nvidiaは、ロボットや自動運転の車が人にけがをさせないようにする新しい技術を作りました。この技術は、工場や倉庫で働くロボットなどに使われます。", "lead_zh": "英伟达开发出一项新技术，能让机器人和自动驾驶汽车不伤害到人。这项技术将用于在工厂和仓库里工作的机器人等。", "preview": "NvidiaはAIのチップを作る会社です。今、ロボットや自動運転の技術にたくさんお金を使っています。2025年、自動運転車の安全のための「Halos」というシステムを作りました。2026年6月には、ロボットのための「Halos for Robotics」も作りました。", "preview_zh": "英伟达是一家做AI芯片的公司。现在它在机器人和自动驾驶技术上投入了大量资金。2025年，它开发了用于自动驾驶汽车安全的“Halos”系统。2026年6月，它又开发了面向机器人的“Halos for Robotics”。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 277, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 97.625, "size_bytes": 589536, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 293, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/287.json"}, {"content_hash": "7258ab609798ec5f", "version_id": 288, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "Nvidia、物理AIに大きな投資——安全なロボタクシーと人型ロボットを目指す", "title_zh": "英伟达重金押注物理AI，想让无人出租车和人形机器人更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 791, "reading_minutes": 2.7, "lead": "NvidiaはAIデータセンターだけでなく、ロボットや自動運転車などの「物理AI」にも何十億ドルも投資しています。2026年にはロボット向けの安全システム「Halos for Robotics」を発表し、人型ロボットや倉庫ロボットの安全な運用を目指しています。", "lead_zh": "英伟达不仅在AI数据中心上赚钱，还砸下几十亿美元投资机器人、自动驾驶这些“物理AI”。2026年它推出了面向机器人的安全系统“Halos for Robotics”，想让工厂和仓库里的机器人工作起来更安全。", "preview": "NvidiaはAIチップで有名ですが、最近はロボットや自動運転車のような「物理AI」にも力を入れています。2025年に自動運転車向けの安全システム「Halos」を出し、2026年6月にはロボット向けの「Nvidia Halos for Robotics」を発表しました。倉庫で動く", "preview_zh": "英伟达靠AI芯片出名，但最近也在大力投入机器人、自动驾驶这类“物理AI”。2025年它推出了面向自动驾驶汽车的安全系统“Halos”，2026年6月又发布了面向机器人的“Nvidia Halos for Robotics”。目标是让仓库机器人、在工厂里走动的人形机器人，甚至手术机", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 278, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 162.738, "size_bytes": 980208, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 500, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/288.json"}, {"content_hash": "48901558c0c7f838", "version_id": 289, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "Nvidia、フィジカルAIに巨額投資——安全なロボタクシーとヒューマノイドを目指す", "title_zh": "英伟达重金押注物理AI，想让无人出租车和人形机器人更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 674, "reading_minutes": 2.3, "lead": "AI半導体大手のNvidiaは、ロボットや自動運転車などの「フィジカルAI」に数十億ドルを投じている。その中核となるのが、事故のリスクを減らすための安全システムである。", "lead_zh": "AI芯片巨头英伟达正在向机器人、自动驾驶汽车等“物理AI”领域投入数十亿美元。其中的核心，是一套用来降低事故风险的安全系统。", "preview": "Nvidiaは2025年、自動運転車などに安全の仕組みを組み込むためのハードウェアとソフトウェアからなる「Halos」システムを発表した。さらに2026年6月には、倉庫の移動ロボットや工場内を歩くヒューマノイド、手術ロボットなどにも対象を広げた「Nvidia Halos for ", "preview_zh": "英伟达于2025年发布了一套名为“Halos”的软硬件系统，用于给自动驾驶汽车等设备加上安全机制。到了2026年6月，公司又推出“Nvidia Halos for Robotics”，把适用范围扩大到仓库搬运机器人、在工厂里走动的人形机器人以及手术机器人等。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 279, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 141.162, "size_bytes": 850752, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 410, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/289.json"}, {"content_hash": "2c408aa3ab08fc78", "version_id": 290, "article_id": 29, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "エヌビディア、フィジカルAIに巨額投資——ロボタクシーと人型ロボットの安全性向上を狙う", "title_zh": "英伟达豪赌“实体AI”，想让无人出租车和人形机器人更安全", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "arstechnica", "source_url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/nvidias-big-bet-on-physical-ai-aims-for-safer-robotaxis-humanoid-robots/", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://cdn.stocksnap.io/img-thumbs/960w/C9B37875B9.jpg", "credit": "Alejandro Escamilla · cc0 1.0 · via stocksnap"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 774, "reading_minutes": 2.6, "lead": "AI半導体大手エヌビディアは、データセンター向け事業だけでなく、ロボティクスや自動運転といった「フィジカルAI」分野にも数十億ドルを投じてきた。その中核を成すのが、機械が人に危害を加えるリスクを低減するフルスタックの安全システムである。", "lead_zh": "AI芯片巨头英伟达不仅在数据中心业务上发力，还在机器人和自动驾驶等“实体AI”领域砸下数十亿美元。其中的核心，是一套能降低机器伤人风险的全栈安全系统。", "preview": "エヌビディアは2025年、自動運転車などに安全の歯止めを組み込むためのハードウェアとソフトウェアを備えた「Halos」を投入した。さらに2026年6月には「Nvidia Halos for Robotics」を発表し、倉庫を走る自律移動ロボットや工場内を歩く人型ロボット、果ては手", "preview_zh": "英伟达于2025年推出“Halos”，用硬件和软件帮助自动驾驶汽车等设备设置安全防线。到了2026年6月，公司又发布“Nvidia Halos for Robotics”，把适用范围扩大到仓库里的自主移动机器人、在工厂里走动的人形机器人，甚至手术机器人。机器人业务负责人阿米特·戈", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 280, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/29/ja_n1.mp3", "duration": 160.15, "size_bytes": 964656, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 466, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/290.json"}, {"content_hash": "e15dd51ab3040ab3", "version_id": 296, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "ja_n5", "lang": "ja", "level": 1, "level_label": "N5 初級", "title": "北極の土を木ではだんにして、あたたかくする", "title_zh": "用木头给北极冻土盖\"毯子\"保暖", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 400, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "北極がだんだんあたたかくなっています。こおりの土がとけて、ガスが出ます。カナダの会社が、木ではだんを作りました。", "lead_zh": "北极正在慢慢变暖。冰冻的土壤融化后会释放气体。加拿大一家公司用木头做了一种\"毯子\"。", "preview": "北極の土は、こおりのようにかたいです。これをえいえいこおりの土と言います。あたたかくなると、この土はとけます。すると、ちきゅうおんだんかのガスが出ます。このガスは、日本と同じくらい多いです。", "preview_zh": "北极的土壤像冰一样硬，这叫永久冻土。天气变暖时，这些土会融化。然后就会释放出导致全球变暖的气体。这些气体和日本排放的一样多。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 286, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 86.987, "size_bytes": 525600, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 260, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/296.json"}, {"content_hash": "18acc79a2e5ab1b1", "version_id": 297, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "木の「毛布」で永久凍土を守る カナダの会社がテスト", "title_zh": "用木头“毯子”保护永久冻土，加拿大公司在做实验", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 390, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "北極の永久凍土がとけています。とけると、温室効果ガスが出ます。カナダの会社が、木の毛布でこれを止めようとしています。", "lead_zh": "北极的永久冻土正在融化。一融化，就会释放温室气体。加拿大一家公司想用木头毯子阻止这件事。", "preview": "カナダの会社「パーマC」が新しい方法を試しています。永久凍土の上に、木くずや土、草の種、ヤシの実の繊維で作った毛布のようなものを置きます。すると、土がこわれにくくなります。会社の人は「土の中の炭素を、そのまま地下に残したい」と言っています。", "preview_zh": "加拿大公司“PermaC”正在尝试一种新方法。他们在永久冻土上铺一种像毯子一样的东西，材料是木屑、泥土、草籽和椰子壳纤维。这样土壤就不容易塌坏。公司的人说：“我们想让土里的碳一直留在地下。”", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 287, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 82.688, "size_bytes": 499824, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/297.json"}, {"content_hash": "80998646282780c0", "version_id": 298, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "永久凍土に「木の毛布」 炭素排出を減らす新技術", "title_zh": "给永久冻土盖上“木头毯子”，新办法减少碳排放", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 577, "reading_minutes": 1.8, "lead": "北極の永久凍土がとけ始め、温室効果ガスが出ています。カナダの新しい会社が、木くずなどで土を覆う方法を試しています。うまくいけば、世界で初めての対策になるかもしれません。", "lead_zh": "北极的永久冻土正在融化，释放出温室气体。加拿大一家新公司正在试验用木屑等材料覆盖土壤的办法。如果成功，这可能成为全球首个直接应对措施。", "preview": "北極では気温が上がっているので、こおっていた土である永久凍土がとけています。そのとき、温室効果ガスが出てしまいます。カナダの新しい会社「パーマック」は、木くずや土、ヤシの実の繊維でできた「毛布」で土を覆う方法を考えました。会社の共同創業者であるチャンス・チュルハさんは、「土の中の", "preview_zh": "由于北极气温上升，原本冻结的土壤——永久冻土正在融化。融化时会释放出温室气体。加拿大新公司“PermaC”想出了用木屑、泥土和椰子纤维做的“毯子”覆盖土壤的办法。公司联合创始人詹苏·楚尔哈说：“我们的目标是让土壤里的碳一直埋在地下。”", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 288, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 119.062, "size_bytes": 718128, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 393, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/298.json"}, {"content_hash": "0593e0cefee9338c", "version_id": 299, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "Woody ‘blankets’ are being deployed on Arctic permafrost to reduce carbon emissions", "title_zh": "", "has_translation": false, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.rawpixel.com/image_1300/cHJpdmF0ZS9sci9pbWFnZXMvd2Vic2l0ZS8yMDIyLTA0L2ZsNDg0MTYwMDkzMjYtaW1hZ2Uta3A0dndxanUuanBn.jpg", "credit": "U.S. Department of Energy · cc0 1.0 · via rawpixel"}, "published_date": "2026-10-08", "word_count": 414, "reading_minutes": 6.1, "lead": "NEWS\n08 October 2026\nWoody ‘blankets’ are being deployed on Arctic permafrost to reduce carbon emissions\nA start-up comp.", "lead_zh": "", "preview": "NEWS\n08 October 2026\nWoody ‘blankets’ are being deployed on Arctic permafrost to reduce carbon emissions\nA start-up company is testing wheth", "preview_zh": "", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 289, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/audio/30/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 245.162, "size_bytes": 1474704, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 435, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8760f31/content/data/versions/299.json"}, {"content_hash": "c524f2cc4d4037ef", "version_id": 300, "article_id": 30, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "Woody ‘blankets’ are being deployed on Arctic permafrost to reduce carbon emissions", "title_zh": "", "has_translation": false, "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03045-8", 